==English==

===Noun===
'''props'''

# {{plural of|[[prop]]}}
# {{slang}} "proper respect" or "proper recognition" for another person; an expression of approval or a special acknowledgment; [[accolade]] or [[accolade]]s; [[praise]].
#: ''I've got to give '''props''' to Roger for the way he handled that situation.''
#: ''"I also want to acknowledge state senator Elaine Alquist who is here... I always want to give her her '''props'''.''" -Barack Obama speaking at Google.

