===meanings and examples===
'''props'''

1.proper respect

ex:- I have to give my props to the governor for the way he handled the problem

2.any movable articles or objects used on the set of a play or movie


ex:- before every scene he ran down his checklist of props

3. support by placing against something solid or rigid


ex:- shore and buttress an old building